{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Regular;\">支聯會煽動顛覆國家政權案，法庭裁定支聯會及前正副主席李卓人、鄒幸彤罪名成立，連同開審前認罪的另一前副主席何俊仁，法庭下周五處理他們的求情。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">➤　</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190433-%E6%94%AF%E8%81%AF%E6%9C%83%E6%A1%88%E6%94%AF%E8%81%AF%E6%9C%83%E6%9D%8E%E5%8D%93%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%8A%E9%84%92%E5%B9%B8%E5%BD%A4%E7%BD%AA%E5%90%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E9%80%A3%E5%90%8C%E4%BD%95%E4%BF%8A%E4%BB%81%E6%B3%95%E5%BA%AD%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%A8%E4%BA%94%E8%99%95%E7%90%86%E6%B1%82%E6%83%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">支聯會案｜支聯會、李卓人及鄒幸彤罪名成立　連同何俊仁法庭下周五處理求情</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Regular;\">行政長官李家超回應裁決，指各被告長期以來的行為危害國家安全，其陰謀昭然若揭，必須予以懲治。警方國安處相信案件有助警方日後執法。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">➤　</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190435-%E6%94%AF%E8%81%AF%E6%9C%83%E6%A1%88%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E7%A8%B1%E5%BF%85%E9%A0%88%E4%BA%88%E4%BB%A5%E6%87%B2%E6%B2%BB%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E5%9C%8B%E5%AE%89%E8%99%95%E6%96%99%E5%8A%A9%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E5%9F%B7%E6%B3%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">支聯會案｜李家超稱必須予以懲治　警方國安處料助警方執法</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Regular;\">警方繼續調查打鼓嶺狗場女子懷疑被狗咬死。據了解，涉事狗隻由狗義工轉交予狗場。有馴犬師指，訓練時需有其他人在場，發生危險時可有人接應。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">➤　</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190438-%E6%89%93%E9%BC%93%E5%B6%BA%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%BA%E6%BC%81%E8%AD%B7%E7%BD%B2%E6%B6%89%E4%BA%8B%E7%8B%97%E9%9A%BB%E4%B8%A6%E9%9D%9E%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%94%90%E7%8B%97%E7%9B%B8%E4%BF%A1%E5%B1%AC%E6%9C%89%E6%A0%BC%E9%AC%A5%E7%8A%AC%E6%B7%B7%E8%A1%80%E5%93%81%E7%A8%AE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">打鼓嶺狗咬死人｜漁護署：涉事狗隻並非一般唐狗　相信屬有格鬥犬混血品種</a><br/><br/>➤　<a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190430-%E6%89%93%E9%BC%93%E5%B6%BA%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%A8%E6%B8%AF%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%8929%E9%9A%BB%E6%A0%BC%E9%AC%A5%E7%8B%97%E6%8C%81%E7%89%8C%E5%8F%A3%E7%BD%A9%E7%8B%97%E5%B8%B6%E8%A6%8F%E5%AE%9A%E7%BD%B0%E5%89%87%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">延伸閱讀｜全港只有29隻格鬥狗持牌　口罩狗帶規定罰則一文看清</a><br/><br/>➤　<a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190422-%E6%89%93%E9%BC%93%E5%B6%BA%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%BA%E7%B6%B2%E5%82%B3%E6%B6%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%94%90%E7%8B%97%E7%82%BA%E6%B7%B7%E7%A8%AE%E6%83%A1%E7%8A%AC%E5%9B%9B%E6%A0%BC%E9%AC%A5%E7%8B%97%E7%B4%94%E7%A8%AE%E6%B7%B7%E7%A8%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%BC%B8%E6%B8%AF%E7%B6%B2%E7%B5%A1%E7%86%B1%E8%A9%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">打鼓嶺狗咬死人｜網傳涉事唐狗為混種惡犬　四格鬥狗純種混種不得輸港｜網絡熱話</a><br/><br/>➤　<a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190220-%E5%86%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%97%E7%84%A1%E7%B9%A9%E9%81%8A%E8%95%A9%E5%A4%96%E5%82%AD%E6%94%BE%E7%8B%97%E5%8F%AA%E9%A1%A7%E5%82%BE%E9%9B%BB%E8%A9%B1%E6%B3%95%E4%BE%8B%E8%A6%8F%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%9C%BE%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9%E9%A0%88%E7%94%A8%E5%B8%B6%E7%89%BD%E5%BC%95%E7%AD%89%E7%B6%B2%E7%B5%A1%E7%86%B1%E8%A9%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">再有大狗無繩遊蕩　外傭放狗只顧傾電話　法例規定公眾地方須用帶牽引等｜網絡熱話</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Regular;\">接連發生狗咬死狗和咬死人事件，食環署提醒狗主攜帶寵物狗進入食肆時需遵守法例。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: SourceHanSansCNRegular;\">➤　</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190441-%E7%8B%97%E9%9A%BB%E5%85%A5%E9%A3%9F%E8%82%86%E9%A3%9F%E7%92%B0%E7%BD%B2%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%BB%E5%B8%B6%E5%AF%B5%E7%89%A9%E7%8B%97%E5%85%A5%E9%A3%9F%E8%82%86%E6%99%82%E9%9C%80%E5%AE%88%E6%B3%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">狗隻入食肆｜食環署提醒狗主帶寵物狗入食肆時需守法</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T09:20:24.390699+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":495,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}